        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Review Request System (PET WF7)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Automatically request reviews from clients 24 hours after their visit to improve online reputation\n\n**🚀 Features:**\n• **Smart Timing:** 24-hour delay allows clients to process their experience\n• **Multi-Channel Outreach:** Both SMS and email review requests\n• **Personalized Messages:** Includes pet names and visit details\n• **Complete Logging:** All requests tracked in Google Sheets\n• **Flexible Triggers:** Workflow trigger or webhook endpoint\n\n**⚡ Workflow Triggers:**\n• **Primary:** Activated by PET WF3 (Visit Completion Orchestrator)\n• **Secondary:** Manual webhook endpoint: {{REVIEW_REQUEST_WEBHOOK_PATH}}\n\n**📊 Integration Points:**\n• Review Tracking: {{REVIEW_REQUESTS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Client Communication: SMS via {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}}\n• Email Communication: Gmail via {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}\n• Review Platform: {{GOOGLE_REVIEWS_URL}}\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Wait Time: 24 hours post-visit\n• Multi-channel approach: SMS + Email\n• Complete audit trail with timestamps",
