        "subject": "🌟 Share Your Experience at {{CLINIC_NAME}} - {{ $json.petName || $json['Pet Name'] || 'Your Pet' }}'s Visit",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }\n    .container { background: white; border-radius: 15px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n    .header { text-align: center; color: #{{CLINIC_COLOR}}; border-bottom: 3px solid #{{CLINIC_COLOR}}; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; }\n    .greeting { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #333; }\n    .highlight { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd, #ffeaa7); padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 5px solid #{{CLINIC_COLOR}}; }\n    .review-cta { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }\n    .review-button { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #{{CLINIC_COLOR}}, #28a745); color: white; padding: 15px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 25px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; transition: all 0.3s ease; }\n    .pet-info { background: #e8f5e8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #666; font-size: 14px; }\n    .stars { color: #ffc107; font-size: 24px; margin: 10px 0; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>🐾 {{CLINIC_NAME}} 🐾</h1>\n      <p>Quality Pet Care with Heart</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"greeting\">\n      <p>Hello {{ $json.clientName || $json['Customer Name'] }},</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"highlight\">\n      <h2>🌟 Thank you for choosing us! 🌟</h2>\n      <p>We hope {{ $json.petName || $json['Pet Name'] || 'your beloved pet' }} is feeling wonderful after their recent visit with us!</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"pet-info\">\n        <h3>📋 Visit Summary:</h3>\n        <p><strong>Pet:</strong> {{ $json.petName || $json['Pet Name'] || 'Your Pet' }}</p>\n        <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{ $json.visitDate || $json['Date'] || 'Recent Visit' }}</p>\n        <p><strong>Service:</strong> {{ $json.service || $json['Service'] || 'Quality Pet Care' }}</p>\n        <p><strong>Veterinarian:</strong> {{ $json.veterinarian || '{{HEAD_VETERINARIAN}}' }}</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"review-cta\">\n      <h3>✨ Your Experience Matters ✨</h3>\n      <div class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n      <p>Help other pet parents discover the quality care we provide!</p>\n      <p>Would you mind taking a moment to share your experience?</p>\n      \n      <a href=\"{{GOOGLE_REVIEWS_URL}}\" class=\"review-button\">🌟 Leave a Google Review 🌟</a>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"background: #f0f8ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n      <h3>🏥 Why Reviews Help:</h3>\n      <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">\n        <li>Help other pet parents find quality care</li>\n        <li>Support our mission to provide excellent service</li>\n        <li>Share your positive experience with the community</li>\n        <li>Help us continue improving our services</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p><strong>Stay Connected:</strong></p>\n      <p>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}}</p>\n      <p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}</p>\n      <p>🌐 <strong>Website:</strong> {{BUSINESS_WEBSITE}}</p>\n      <p>📍 <strong>Address:</strong> {{CLINIC_ADDRESS}}</p>\n      <p>🕒 <strong>Hours:</strong> {{CLINIC_HOURS}}</p>\n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: #e8f5e8; border-radius: 8px;\">\n        <p>Thank you for trusting {{CLINIC_NAME}} with {{ $json.petName || $json['Pet Name'] || 'your pet' }}'s health and happiness! 🐾❤️</p>\n        <p><em>- The {{CLINIC_NAME}} Team</em></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
          "replyTo": "{{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}",
          "ccEmail": ""
        }
